Dear Viviana,

This isn't strictly about the R package geomorph, this is about using the R package rgl. But rgl.material is probably where you need to experiment.

Plot the mesh using mesh3d() and play with the settings of rgl.material, particularly
  ambient
  specular
  emission

You can also overlay the triangles using lines3d() in a different colour entirely if you wish.

Emma

